      <p class="eyebrow">A VISUAL JOURNEY ACROSS TIME</p>
      <h2>Places, people, and knowledge</h2>
      <p>These carefully selected archival and contemporary images offer four different windows into Native life: places, writing and knowledge, family life, and traditional craft. They do not represent every nation, and each image should be read with its date, place, creator, and original source in mind.</p>
      <div class="archive-grid">
